      <Docs>
        <summary>Returns the anchor floor number.</summary>
        <value>the anchor floor number or Double.NaN if the anchor floor number is unknown.</value>
        <remarks>
          <para>Returns the anchor floor number.</para>
          <para>The unit is floor and the resolution of this value is about 1/16 of a floor.</para>
          <para>The highest floor number which can be represented is 8191/16 = (roughly) 512 floors.</para>
          <para>The lowest floor number which can be represented is -8191/16 = (roughly) -512 floors.</para>
          <para>The anchor floor number is unknown if the value is Double.NaN.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/ranging/DlTdoaMeasurement.ZElementExtension#getAnchorFloorNumber()" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.ranging.DlTdoaMeasurement.ZElementExtension.getAnchorFloorNumber</code>.</a></format></para>
